    "description": "The Hotel Room Availability API allows users to check the availability of rooms in real-time. This endpoint responds to requests for room availability within specified parameters, enabling consumers such as travel agencies, booking platforms, and hotel management systems to provide up-to-date information to their users. Developers can leverage this API to integrate room availability checks into their applications, enhancing user experience and streamlining booking processes. Typical use cases include checking room availability for a given date range and occupancy requirements.",
